### Test Order List with no filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Order List with date range filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?FromDate=2024-01-01&ToDate=2024-12-31
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Order List with search filter (order number)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?SearchQuery=ORDER
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Order List with customer filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?CustomerId=1
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Order List with price range filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?MinPrice=100&MaxPrice=1000
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Order List with multiple filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?FromDate=2024-01-01&ToDate=2024-12-31&SearchQuery=ORDER&MinPrice=100&MaxPrice=1000&OrderStatuses=Pending,Processing
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Order List with pagination and sorting
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?PageNumber=1&PageSize=5&SortBy=CreationTime&SortDirection=desc
Content-Type: application/json
